---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const updated = 'July 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms governing your use of the Lawrence Law Property website and its property information."
>
  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="label-sm mt-3 text-ink/50">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      <div class="gold-rule mt-4"></div>

      <div class="prose-zh">
        <p>
          By using this website (“the Site”), you agree to the terms below. If you do not agree,
          please do not use the Site.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          This Site is the personal website of <strong>Lawrence Law</strong>, a registered estate
          negotiator ({SITE.renNumber}) practising in Malaysia under the oversight of the Board of
          Valuers, Appraisers, Estate Agents and Property Managers (BOVAEA). Services for property
          buyers are provided at no charge to the buyer; remuneration is received from developers
          or as otherwise provided by law and industry practice.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Information, not advice</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>All content on this Site — including articles, videos, area guides and property listings — is provided for <strong>general information only</strong>. It is not financial, investment or legal advice.</li>
          <li>Property purchase involves significant financial commitment. Always verify current facts (prices, loan terms, government policies, taxes and exemptions) with the relevant bank, lawyer, developer or authority before making decisions.</li>
          <li>Market commentary reflects personal views at the time of writing and may become outdated.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Property listings</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Prices shown (e.g. “From RM …”), maintenance rates, estimated monthly instalments, land sizes and completion dates are <strong>indicative</strong>, provided by developers, and subject to change or withdrawal without notice;</li>
          <li>Estimated monthly instalments are illustrations only and do not constitute a loan offer; actual financing depends on bank approval and your personal circumstances;</li>
          <li>Images may include artist's impressions. The Sale and Purchase Agreement and its schedules are the only binding description of any property.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. No client relationship by browsing</h2>
        <p>
          Browsing this Site or reading its content does not create an agent–client engagement.
          An engagement arises only when both parties expressly agree to work together on a
          specific transaction.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise stated, the content of this Site (text, articles, graphics and the
          Lawrence Law Property™ name and logo) belongs to Lawrence Law Property. You may share
          links to this Site freely; do not reproduce substantial parts of its content for
          commercial use without permission.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          The Site links to third-party platforms (WhatsApp, social media, developer pages). We are
          not responsible for their content, availability or practices.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Lawrence Law Property shall not be liable for any
          loss arising from reliance on the Site's content or from the use of, or inability to use,
          the Site. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded under
          Malaysian law.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time; the latest version on this page applies.
          Continued use of the Site after changes means you accept the updated terms.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Malaysia.</p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Lawrence Law ({SITE.renNumber})
          <br />WhatsApp: +6019-9939 860
          <br />Email: {SITE.email}
          <br />Address: {SITE.address}
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-xs text-ink/50">
        These terms were drafted for Lawrence Law Property's website. They are general information,
        not legal advice — have a lawyer review them before relying on them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
